# The slate's lines and its keys, from a normal start: what to want standing on
# the HUD, every app opened by the key its own tab names, long work set going at
# a fire the player lays and watched from the page, a thing put down from the
# carrying page, and a location caption that is right the instant the player is
# somewhere else.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/slate-polish.tour --seed=7 --hour=10 --weather=clear:0 --give=driftwood:8,stone:4
coast calm
wait 1.6
shot 01-woken-the-ping-has-the-top
# The guide says what to want; once its line has faded, the goal stands on.
wait 5
shot 02-goal-on-the-hud
# Making: a fire laid by hand, then charcoal set going on it and left.
tap craft
await app:crafting 3
shot 03-making-and-its-keys
choose campfire
tap use
await made 4
wait 0.6
shot 04-fire-laid
choose charcoal
shot 05-ready-at
tap use
wait 0.8
shot 06-on-now
tap pause
await app:none 3
# Carrying: X puts down what is not needed, onto a heap the world keeps.
tap inventory
await app:inventory 3
shot 07-carrying-and-its-keys
choose stone
shot 08-stone-chosen
tap drop
wait 0.6
shot 09-put-down
tap pause
await app:none 3
wait 0.6
shot 10-the-heap-it-went-on
# Home, and the three apps that hang off it on the strip.
tap pause
await app:pause 3
shot 11-home
choose loadout
tap use
await app:loadout 3
shot 12-gear
tap pause
await app:pause 3
choose reads
tap use
await app:reads 3
shot 13-machine-reads
tap pause
await app:pause 3
choose saves
tap use
await app:saves 3
shot 14-saves
tap pause
await app:pause 3
choose controls
tap use
wait 0.4
shot 15-controls-say-x
tap pause
wait 0.3
tap pause
await app:none 3
# The map on its own key, and back to the world.
tap map
await app:map 3
shot 16-map
tap map
await app:none 3
# The caption is right the instant the player is somewhere else, and its
# brackets close in from outside the word rather than over the letters.
place snowfield
wait 0.35
shot 17-caption-closing-in
wait 0.8
shot 18-caption-snowfield
place burning
wait 1.0
shot 19-caption-burning
place moss
wait 1.0
shot 20-caption-moss
# The goal stands on over the brightest ground there is, once the ping is done.
place snowfield
wait 5
shot 21-the-goal-over-bright-ground
